      "title": "Exam Proctor (Per-Diem) - Herbert Wertheim College of Medicine",
      "description": "Posted Date: 2026-08-21 Department: COM Academic Affairs College: Herbert Wertheim College of Medicine Job family: Temporary Location: Modesto A. Maidique Campus About FIU Florida International University is a Top 50, preeminent public research university with 55,000 students from all 50 states and more than 140 countries, as well as an alumni network of more than 340,000. Located in the global city of Miami, the university offers more than 200 degree programs at the undergraduate, graduate and professional levels, including medicine and law. FIU faculty are leaders in their fields and include National Academy members, Fulbright Scholars and MacArthur Genius Fellows. A Carnegie R1 institution, FIU drives impactful research in environmental resilience, health and technology and innovation. Home to the Wall of Wind and Institute of Environment, FIU stands at the forefront of discovery and innovation. With a focus on student success, economic mobility and community engagement, FIU is redefining what it means to be a public research university. Job Summary The Herbert Wertheim College of Medicine is currently seeking an Exam Proctor (Per-Diem) to join our team of professionals Duties: Serves as an administrator during specific examinations for students within the Herbert Wertheim College of Medicine Prepares and distributes exam related materials prior to the test administration Maintains proper records of student attendance upon arrival and departure from exam area Continuously observes students during examinations Responds to student requests and resolve inquiries or issues as needed Utilizes software systems to provide administrative support or assessments (e.g., EValue, ExamSoft, NBME). Job Category Temporary Minimum Qualifications High School Diploma or GED. Work Schedule ON CALL - Approximately 15 hours per week Advertised Salary $17.00 per hour Pre-Employment Requirements Criminal Background Check Temporary Disclosure As a temporary employee