      "title": "Parking Student Assistant (MMC)",
      "description": "Posted Date: 2026-05-18 Department: Parking and Transportation College: Operations and Safety Job family: Student Location: Modesto A. Maidique Campus; Modesto A. Maidique Campus Job Summary FIU's Department of Parking and Transportation is seeking a motivated, detail-oriented, and service-driven Student Operations Assistant to join our dynamic team. This role is ideal for students eager to deliver exceptional service while gaining experience in event ops, customer service, and transportation logistics. Key Responsibilities: Provide customer service via in-person support, phone, chat, and email. Assist the Customer Service Center with front desk transactions and data entry. Support enforcement operations by patrolling lots/garages using an LPR vehicle and issuing citations. Direct traffic at major campus events to ensure smooth vehicle flow. Assist with signage setup/removal and physical logistics for events. Help coordinate transportation services (GPE, CATS, Panther Mover, TapRide). Maintain cleanliness and safety in assigned areas. Report safety concerns or incidents promptly. Work flexible hours, including evenings and weekends. Perform other duties as assigned by admin. About FIU Florida International University is a Top 50, preeminent public research university with 55,000 students from all 50 states and more than 140 countries, as well as an alumni network of more than 340,000. Located in the global city of Miami, the university offers more than 200 degree programs at the undergraduate, graduate and professional levels, including medicine and law. FIU faculty are leaders in their fields and include National Academy members, Fulbright Scholars and MacArthur Genius Fellows. A Carnegie R1 institution, FIU drives impactful research in environmental resilience, health and technology and innovation. Home to the Wall of Wind and Institute of Environment, FIU stands at the forefront of discovery and innovation. With a focus on student success, e