mum Qualifications Production and technical operation knowledge Experience in Front of House, Lightboard/Soundboard Operator Services, and School of Music Stage Support Job Summary The School of Music is currently seeking a Music Production Student Assistant to join their team of professionals. Duties to include: Technical support for School of Music rentals Front of house support Light board operator Sound board operator Stage support Assist with program policies"
