ment must end. Desired Qualifications Science background (Environmental Science, Biology, Chemistry, or related field) Ability to communicate effectively with faculty, staff, and students Strong organizational skills and attention to detail Basic knowledge of laboratory safety procedures and chemical handling Job Category Federal Work Study Job Summary The Earth and Environment is currently seeking a Lab Student Assistant to join their team of professionals. Duties to include: Conduct and maintain chemical inventory records Calibrate and maintain laboratory instruments, including pH meters and water quality meters Prepare and update chemical inventories, supply lists, and laboratory documentation Assist with laboratory organization, equipment maintenance, and safety compliance Support faculty and laboratory staff with routine laboratory operations and projects Communicate effectively regarding inventory status, equipment issues, and laboratory needs"
