t must end. Desired Qualifications Minimum Qualifications: Knowledge of computer software programs (ie, MicroSoft Office Suite) Familiar with Excel and Qualtrics Ability to follow written and verbal instruction Ability to communicate clearly and concisely, verbally and in writing Ability to demonstrate a strong attention to detail Ability to meet deadlines Job Category Federal Work Study Job Summary Duties: Support the Graduate Certificate in Molecular and Biomedical Sciences (GCP) Work with Microsoft Office suite applications including Outlook, Word, Excel, Powerpoint, OneNote, Teams, Access Update spreadsheets and databases Update GCP Outlook calendar Send targeted e-mailings Create and deliver surveys using Qualtrics Software Support GCP faculty with classroom technology including Echo360 and Intedashboard. Maintain folders and files of course presentations and activities Maintain inventory of GCP supplies Support GCP faculty and staff at GCP events"
