      "title": "2026-2027 Athletics Department, Sports Operations Student Assistant (Indoor Volleyball)",
      "description": "Posted Date: 2026-07-13 Department: Athletics Department College: Athletics Job family: Federal Work Study Location: Modesto A. Maidique Campus About FIU Florida International University is a Top 50, preeminent public research university with 55,000 students from all 50 states and more than 140 countries, as well as an alumni network of more than 340,000. Located in the global city of Miami, the university offers more than 200 degree programs at the undergraduate, graduate and professional levels, including medicine and law. FIU faculty are leaders in their fields and include National Academy members, Fulbright Scholars and MacArthur Genius Fellows. A Carnegie R1 institution, FIU drives impactful research in environmental resilience, health and technology and innovation. Home to the Wall of Wind and Institute of Environment, FIU stands at the forefront of discovery and innovation. With a focus on student success, economic mobility and community engagement, FIU is redefining what it means to be a public research university. Job Summary Florida International University (FIU) (Modesto Maidique Campus) is seeking an individual to serve as a Federal Work Study as a Sports Operation Student Assistant (Indoor Volleyball) The successful candidate will assist the Volleyball teams in coordinating and preparing the team and recruiting travel and works in compliance with NCAA bylaws. Duties include:' Coordinate with the Athletic Department Administration and serve as a liaison for Indoor Volleyball team with various university units (housing and SAAC) on issues related to each respective area Works with Head Coach and assistant coaches with the teams and recruiting travel (including travel authorization requests, buses/vans, hotels, and food); game day operations for the teams at home (away, as needed) competitions Follows FIU procedures in handling all ordering of supplies Reviews, understands, and abides by all department procedures' Maintains confidenti