xcellent customer service to all departments within athletics' Ability to multi-task' Knowledge of PC operations and software' Ability to excel in a team environment Ability to lift and handle heavy equipment' Assists with production of Athletic events.' Assist with gameday operations. Setup and breakdown of events Assist with visiting team logistics. Assist with pre/post -game meals. Assist in setting up fields and game areas for gameday. Assist with in-game logistics. Assist the Assistant Athletic Director of Facilities and Game Operations with everyday needs to run the athletic facilities. Reviewing daily checklists to ensure everything is operating well in the facility. Adhere to all State of Florida, FIU, NCAA, Conference USA, and department rules and policies. Serve as point of contact for all internal and external athletics partners at FIU Athletics events. Perform related duties as assigned"
