ns (e.g. dental, vision,) which requires full payment on your part. Upon completing an assignment, employees may apply for a position on FIU Careers. Job Category Temporary Pre-Employment Requirements Advertised Salary $22 an hour Work Schedule Monday - Friday 1 Year 30 Hours Desired Qualifications Qualification ' Education: High school diploma or equivalent required; some college coursework or an associate degree preferred. ' Experience: Experience with administrative support, website content updates, spreadsheets, data entry, or office technology preferred. ' Technical skills: Familiarity with Microsoft Office, particularly Excel or Sheets; website content management systems, reporting tools, and university administrative systems. ' Data skills: Basic experience organizing data, maintaining spreadsheets, verifying data accuracy, and preparing reports. ' Preferred skills: Exposure to Qualtrics, Zoom, Canvas, workflow automation, website editing, or data visualization tools. ' Core competencies: Strong attention to detail, organization, communication, customer service, problem-solving, and ability to follow established procedures. Minimum Qualifications Bachelor's degree and two (2) years of appropriate experience, or Master's degree. Job Summary"
